ct break during an earthquake and injures himself on a mysterious shard. Soon after, eerie rumors emerge, leading Shō and his classmates to investigate what may be the start of something far bigger.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11197246/screencap/68697185985cb.jpg"},{"title":"Branch 02","episodeNumber":2,"sourceEpisodeNumber":2,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18660","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"177761","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"mal","id":"58957","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"270931","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"450624","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]}],"link":"99555","synopsis":"When a strange fire erupts at school, Shō races to save his sister and teams up with the mysterious Miyako, who reveals knowledge of supernatural powers. Together, they face a pyrokinetic enemy, using an \"Artifact\" to awaken hidden abilities and fight back.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11211716/screencap/686971fee4368.jpg"},{"title":"Branch 03","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18660","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"177761","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"58957","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"270931","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"450624","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"99567","synopsis":"While investigating the petrification case, Shō and Miyako grow closer and uncover new uses for her Artifact, which steals ownership. But just as they make progress, a girl named Nia arrives and begins to suspect Shō as the true culprit.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11211717/screencap/6873c37959c6e.jpg"},{"title":"Branch 04","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18660","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"177761","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"58957","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"270931","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"450624","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"99576","synopsis":"Miyako learns of Shō’s feelings through his memories, straining their bond, but with Yoichi’s help, they begin to rebuild their connection. Just as they start to reconcile, Miyako vanishes amid a new petrification case, prompting Shō to search for her in growing fear.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11211718/screencap/68da7f2f23bf4.jpg"},{"title":"Branch 05","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18660","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"177761","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"58957","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"270931","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"450624","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"99772","synopsis":"Shō experiences a mysterious déjà vu at the shrine, while Sophitia hints he may be linked to a rare Artifact. At the same time, Amane investigates the \"Queen of Eden\" and is caught up in a dangerous encounter with a mysterious group—including the enigmatic \"Ghost\".","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11211719/screencap/68da7f66e13e6.jpg"},{"title":"Branch 06","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18660","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"177761","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"58957","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"270931"